{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12328","headline":"游襄阳泉石晚归 · 钱起","name":"游襄阳泉石晚归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游目随山胜，回桡爱浦长。\n往来幽不浅，昏旦兴难忘。\n木末看归翼，莲西失夕阳。\n人声指闾井，野趣惜林塘。\n稍近垂杨路，菱舟拥岸香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}